    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171660/extras/99199b29c10bc20f1cecfe1ae4499e0c.avif?t=1731364789\" /></div><br><br>Welcome to the post-apocalyptic story Tuda:Kuda, created by one person \u2013 Vladimir \u201cVladi\u201d Kuzmin.<br><br>Fight the infected, explore the locations, collect everything you need for the plane and escape from this dying place.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A 5-round revolver and sleight of hand are the only things you can rely on<br></li><li>Infected people can be behind every door - be careful<br></li><li>Patch up the old plane to move to a better place<br></li><li>Monitor your condition with a heart rate monitor<br></li><li>Atmospheric locations with their own stories<br></li><li>Classic pixel graphics drawn by hand</li></ul>",
